:: Campus Math
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !School.isSchoolDay()>><<goto "Linkon University">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-math", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<if School.earlyArrival("math")>>\
<<schoolEarly "math">>\
<<schoolStudyBefore "math">>\
<<actionIcon "exit">><<link "Leave the classroom <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Linkon University">><</link>>
<<elseif $schoolStudyBefore && $schoolStudyBefore.roomKey === "math">>\
<<goto "Math Study Transition">>\
<<elseif !Flags.get(MathClass.FIRST_FLAG) && MathClass.isInSession()>>\
<<goto "Math Class Begin">>\
<<elseif MathClass.needsEnd()>>\
<<run MathClass.rollEnd()>>\
<<run MathClass.markEndDone()>>\
<<goto "Math Class End">>\
<<else>>\
You are in the math classroom.<<if MathClass.isInSession()>>\
<<run MathClass.rollDuring()>>\
 <<= $mathDuringText>><<= $mathDuringEffects>>
<<schoolFocus "math">>\
<<else>>

<<actionIcon "exit">><<link "Leave the classroom <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Linkon University">><</link>>
<</if>>\
<</if>>

:: Math Study Transition
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !$schoolStudyBefore || $schoolStudyBefore.roomKey !== "math">><<goto "Campus Math">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-math", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<set _sb to $schoolStudyBefore>>\
<<unset $schoolStudyBefore>>\
You study diligently, until the bell rings. <<= _sb.effectMarkup>>

<<link "Next">>\
<<if !Flags.get(MathClass.FIRST_FLAG) && MathClass.isInSession()>>\
<<goto "Math Class Begin">>\
<<else>>\
<<goto "Campus Math">>\
<</if>>\
<</link>>

:: Math Class Begin
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !School.isSchoolDay() || !MathClass.isInSession()>><<goto "Campus Math">><</if>>\
<<run Flags.set(MathClass.FIRST_FLAG)>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-math", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
The bell rings, signalling that class has begun. With the final signal, the teacher is still nowhere in sight, until the door flies open, revealing a handsome, middle-aged man with long, curly black hair and wispy strands that fall over his forehead. He has stunning red eyes and alabaster skin, akin to how you think a vampire would look. The sleeves of his button-down are rolled up to his elbows, a cup of tea in one hand, a stack of books in the other.

“Apologies, my young friends!” he chuckles, frantically setting his belongings onto his desk. “I experienced… let’s say, a complication this morning. The new hot water machine in the teachers’ lounge is far too advanced to even be considered a hot water machine. Oh, technology just has a way of going over my head. It’s tragical!” His smile reveals a pair of imperfectly perfect teeth. You can’t help but feel charmed by his natural charisma. <<arousal "+">>

“Ah, I should introduce myself, huh? I’m Professor Zhang, and I will be your math teacher for the foreseeable future. I only ask that you all study hard and show up on time. I don’t want to have a reason to hold any of you bright, young souls back.” He realizes the irony in his statement, his lilted smile falling.

“<i>Ahem…</i> Well then, shall we begin?”

<<link "Next">><<goto "Campus Math">><</link>>

:: Math Class End
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !$mathEnd>><<goto "Linkon University">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-math", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<print $mathEnd.text>>
<<gap>>
<<link `"Next <span class='action-time'>(" + School.formatActionMinutes($mathEnd.minutes) + ")</span>"`>>\
<<run World.advance($mathEnd.minutes)>>\
<<unset $mathEnd>>\
<<goto "Linkon University">>\
<</link>>

:: Math Focus Event
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !$mathFocus>><<goto "Campus Math">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-math", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<= $mathFocus.text>>
<<gap "sm">>
<div class="class-focus-choices">\
<<for _choice range $mathFocus.choices>>\
<<capture _choice>>\
<div class="class-focus-choice"><<link `_choice.label`>>\
<<run MathClass.applyFocusChoice(_choice.id)>>\
<<goto "Math Focus Result">>\
<</link>><<= _choice.previewMarkup>></div>\
<</capture>>\
<</for>>\
</div>

:: Math Focus Result
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !$mathFocusResult>><<goto "Campus Math">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-math", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<= $mathFocusResult.text>><<= $mathFocusResult.effectsMarkup>>
<<gap>>
<<link "Next">>\
<<run MathClass.clearFocusEvent()>>\
<<goto "Campus Math">>\
<</link>>
